<view class="screen upload-screen">
  <view class="flow-head"><view class="flow-step-label">第 1 步，共 4 步</view><view class="flow-title">先选择要处理的表格</view><view class="flow-desc">优先上传原始 Excel；也支持 Word、CSV、文字型 PDF，以及拍照或截图得到的价格表。确认前不会修改商品、价格或库存。</view></view>
  <view class="flow-progress"><view class="flow-progress-value" style="width: 25%;"></view></view>

  <view class="file-drop {{file ? 'selected' : ''}}" bindtap="chooseFile" aria-label="选择表格文件">
    <view class="file-mark">{{file ? (file.kind === 'image' ? '图片' : '文件') : '＋'}}</view>
    <view class="file-title">{{file ? file.name : '选择 Word、Excel、CSV、PDF 或图片'}}</view>
    <view class="file-desc">{{file ? file.sizeText + ' · 点击可重新选择文件' : '从微信会话或手机文件中选择'}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="image-choice" catchtap="chooseImage">
    <view class="image-choice-title">拍照或从相册选择价格表</view>
    <view class="image-choice-desc">请尽量包含完整表头和表格四边，拍摄屏幕时保持正对</view>
  </view>

  <view class="upload-form">
    <view class="upload-field">
      <view class="upload-label">这次准备处理什么</view>
      <picker range="{{purposes}}" value="{{purposeIndex}}" bindchange="changePurpose"><view class="upload-picker">{{purposes[purposeIndex]}}<text>›</text></view></picker>
      <view class="upload-hint">用途会决定必填字段和最后允许修改的数据。</view>
    </view>
    <block wx:if="{{purposes[purposeIndex] === '厂家价格'}}">
      <view class="upload-field">
        <view class="upload-label">这是哪家供应商的价格表</view>
        <picker range="{{supplierNames}}" value="{{supplierIndex < 0 ? 0 : supplierIndex}}" bindchange="changeSupplier"><view class="upload-picker"><text class="picker-value">{{supplierIndex < 0 ? '请选择供应商' : supplierNames[supplierIndex]}}</text><text>›</text></view></picker>
        <view class="upload-hint">用于记录真实价格来源，也用于以后比较同一厂家的版本。</view>
        <view class="supplier-error" wx:if="{{supplierLoadError}}">{{supplierLoadError}}，<text bindtap="retrySuppliers">重新加载</text></view>
      </view>
      <view class="upload-field">
        <view class="upload-label">价格生效日期</view>
        <picker mode="date" value="{{effectiveDate}}" bindchange="changeEffectiveDate"><view class="upload-picker"><text class="picker-value">{{effectiveDate}}</text><text>›</text></view></picker>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="upload-error" wx:if="{{uploadError}}"><view class="upload-error-title">文件没有上传成功</view><view>{{uploadError}}</view><view>文件仍保留在手机中，可以直接再次尝试。</view></view>
  <view class="safety-line"><view class="safety-mark">安</view><view><view class="safety-title">识别和预览不会改动数据</view><view class="safety-desc">价格、库存或正式单据发生变化前，会单独展示影响并再次确认。</view></view></view>
  <view class="fixed-action-space"></view>
  <view class="fixed-action"><button class="fixed-primary {{!file || recognizing ? 'disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="startRecognition" disabled="{{!file || recognizing}}">{{recognizing ? '正在上传并读取文件…' : '上传并读取文件'}}</button></view>
</view>
